title: "real-estate-molit-api: Hedonic pricing models for Korean apartment transactions with spatial correction"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for Korean apartment transaction data (Ministry of Land,
  Infrastructure and Transport, MOLIT): hedonic price models with spatial
  econometric corrections, reproducible from raw API responses.
